        82.30619812011719
      ],
      "text": "MTBDR  (version 1.0) was the first commercial SL-LPA for detection of resistance to second- sl",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
