        70.86609649658203,
        84.66120147705078,
        526.9918823242188,
        97.80619812011719
      ],
      "text": "line TB drugs. In 2015, the manufacturer developed and made commercially available version",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        100.16120147705078,
        526.9639282226562,
        113.30619812011719
      ],
      "text": "2.0 of the MTBDR  assay. Version 2.0 detects the mutations associated with fluoroquinolones  sl",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        115.66120147705078,
        526.794189453125,
        128.8061981201172
      ],
