    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        131.16119384765625,
        526.9149169921875,
        144.3061981201172
      ],
      "text": "mutations. Once a diagnosis of MDR/RR-TB has been established, an SL-LPA can be used to",
