      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        201.66522216796875,
        527.1572875976562,
        214.8102264404297
      ],
      "text": "genes plus   and the   promoter for version 2.0). The presence of mutations in these  gyrB eis",
